cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "passmcp-sdk-cpp: Apache-2.0 C++20 MCP client and server SDK with offline passmcp attestation verification"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: 0.0.10
date-released: 2026-11-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/passmcp-sdk-cpp"
abstract: >-
  Apache-2.0 Model Context Protocol client and server SDK for C++20 covering
  revisions 2025-06-18 through 2026-07-28 (stdio and Streamable HTTP, OAuth 2.1
  with PKCE, SEP-2164 unknown-resource errors, SEP-2549 cache hints, stateless
  server/discover, and read-only client execution defaults) paired with an
  offline verifier for passmcp in-toto evaluation attestations.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - attestation
  - in-toto
  - cpp
license: Apache-2.0
